{"version":1,"content":"<p>網絡服務商 Cloudflare 行政總裁馬修普林斯日前表示，隨着 AI 智能體越來越多地代替用户瀏覽器瀏覽網頁，部分網站正在面臨新的成本壓力：智能體訪問網站、讀取內容並消耗伺服器資源，但最終可能直接向用户給出答案，網站沒有得到實際訪客和真實流量，也沒有獲得收益。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585862.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.454475+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:39:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:39.945014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:39.945014+00:00","content_hash":"674d405fd4d84ac810e315ff374127f662b6e6715b2769a81ac6bdc1542c88f3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}